Dominion's Wholesale Wastewater Facilities include, but are not limited to:
(1)
Wastewater treatment plants;
(2)
Force mains;
(3)
Major gravity interceptor lines;
(4)
Lift stations;
(5)
Effluent discharges;
(6)
Influent facilities;
(7)
Diversions; and
(8)
Other improvements necessary for the conveyance of wastewater from Retail Facilities
to Dominion's water reclamation facilities.
(Rules of 7-17-2019(9), att. G)

Dominion's Wholesale Water Facilities include:
(1)
Water storage rights or facilities;
(2)
Water rights, or contractual water agreements;
(3)
WISE pipelines or capacity in WISE Authority pipelines;
(4)
Water pipelines owned or leased by Dominion necessary to deliver water to a water
treatment plant, a water storage facility, a wastewater treatment plant, etc.;
(5)
Wells and manifolds;
(6)
Potable water tanks;
(7)
Nonpotable water tanks;
(8)
Water treatment plants;
(9)
Diversion and return flow intake structures;
(10)
Rainwater harvesting facilities.
(Rules of 7-17-2019(9), att. H)
